  "definition": "The AccountExcludedMandateMaintenanceRequest message is sent from an organisation to a financial institution as part of the account maintenance process. It is the initial request message to update an account. Usage: this update is about account details excluding any mandate information.|If modification codes are not used: the organisation will specify under the “Account” and “Organisation” tags the complete information as it should be in the financial institution’s records after processing the update request. |If modification codes are used (in that case, they must be used everywhere): the organisation will specify under the “Account” and “Organisation” tags which elements must be added, deleted, modified, or if they are unchanged.",
